  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learning and Knowledge Management Facility UNIDO</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Learning and Knowledge Management Facility UNIDO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att uppr&#xe4;tta en facilitet, vilken skall         inkludera samtliga sk PPPs som finansieras av Sida inom ramen f&#xf6;r     yrkesutbildning. Facilitet skall utg&#xf6;ra en plattform f&#xf6;r &#xf6;msesidigt   l&#xe4;rande, utbyte av kunskap samt f&#xf6;r att kunna identifiera ny          initiativ/&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ra best practices. UNIDO &#xe4;r Sidas kontraktspart.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at establishing a facility integrating the various   public private partnership (PPP) programmes funded by Sida for skills development and will serve as a platform for collaborative learning,  knowledge sharing and indentification of/transfer of best practices.  UNIDO is the Sida contracting partner.</narrative>
  </description>
